size 100 8
start
keys :
type archive
keys <CR>
frame a-frame
write done.txt outside
keys u
frame b-frame
file todo.txt b-todo
file done.txt b-done
-- config.toml --
show_sidebar = false
show_detail = false
-- todo.txt --
x 2026-09-28 A
B

x 2026-09-28 C
D
-- done.txt --
x 2026-09-01 Old
-- outside --
x 2026-09-01 Old
x 2026-09-28 A changed
x 2026-09-28 C
-- a-frame --
┌ [1]─~/todo.txt ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│    ✓     A                                                                              filtered │
│  1       B                                                                                       │
│    ✓     C                                                                              filtered │
│  3       D                                                                                       │
│                                                                                                  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 NORMAL  todo.txt  manual  archived 2 to done.txt; removed 1 blank lines; hidden by current filters
-- b-frame --
┌ [1]─~/todo.txt ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│    ✓     A                                                                              filtered │
│  1       B                                                                                       │
│    ✓     C                                                                              filtered │
│  3       D                                                                                       │
│                                                                                                  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 NORMAL  todo.txt  manual  can't undo: "x 2026-09-28 A" was changed since  x done  t state  o new
